{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:393613c18e211d0f","name":"Weapon Focus","source":{"id":"source:reference-393613c18e211d0f","title":"Weapon Focus","revision":24982,"timestamp":"2024-11-10T16:41:26Z","sha256":"01cb2461048c6a2118437d8320a2d3378f4acd2431e9a1fd9a435ec6e12a8743","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24982","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Weapon%20Focus&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-393613c18e211d0f","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are especially good at using particular weapons.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," Proficient with Chosen Weapon\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," Choose a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapon"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Group"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Group"},", you gain a +1 bonus on all attack rolls you make using the selected ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapon"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Group"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Group"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," You can gain this feat multiple times. Its effects do not stack. Each time you take the feat, it applies to a new ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapon"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Group"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Group"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Combined Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Combined_Feat"},":"]}," If you have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Finesse"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Finesse","referenceId":"reference:7752dd7b768faff2"}," Feat; when you are wielding a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["One-Handed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/One-Handed"}," weapon for which you have Weapon Focus, you can treat that weapon as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Weapon"}," for the purpose of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Finesse"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Finesse","referenceId":"reference:7752dd7b768faff2"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Jedi Counseling"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Counseling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Counseling"},")"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," Weapon Focus (and many other weapon-specific abilities) lists \"proficient with weapon\" among its prerequisites. Can you take that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"}," if you're proficient with at least one weapon in that group, or do you have to be proficient with all weapons in that group?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," As long as you are proficient with at least one weapon in a group, you are qualified to take Weapon Focus (or any other weapon-specific ability) for that group. The benefits apply only for weapons within that group with which you are proficient.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["For example, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scoundrel"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scoundrel","referenceId":"reference:316d580fd4c35ecc"}," with the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Spacehound"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Spacehound"}]}," Talent is proficient with all ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Weapons"}," (all of which are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapons","referenceId":"reference:a2b1d4c4bac82300"},"), so they would qualify to take ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus (Heavy Weapons)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Heavy_Weapons)"},". They would gain a +1 bonus on attacks with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Weapons"},", but they wouldn't get that benefit with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["E-Web Repeating Blaster"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/E-Web_Repeating_Blaster","referenceId":"reference:3bac50ec8614d1fb"}," or any other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Weapon"}," until becoming proficient with them.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," Does that reasoning apply when a prerequisite says \"Weapon Proficiency (",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Group"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Group"},")\"?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," No. When the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Proficiency"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency"}," Feat is specified, you must actually have that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
